TI  - In situ Removal of Hydrogen Sulfide During Biogas Fermentation at Microaerobic Condition
AU  - Wu, Mengmeng
AU  - Zhang, Yima
AU  - Ye, Yuanyuan
AU  - Lin, Chunmian
PY  - 2016
