TI  - Micro-Oxygenation in Upflow Anaerobic Sludge Bed (UASB) Reactors Using a Silicon Membrane for Sulfide Oxidation
AU  - Valdés, Freddy
AU  - Camiloti, Priscila Rosseto
AU  - Bartacek, Jan
AU  - Torres-Aravena, Álvaro
AU  - Toledo-Alarcón, Javiera
