TI  - Considering micro-aeration strategy for enhancing methane production in anaerobic digestion of agricultural wastes
AU  - Zhan, Yuanhang
AU  - Xiao, Yiting
AU  - Schrader, Leland C.
AU  - Robinson Jr., Ndeddy Aka
AU  - Wu, S.
AU  - Zhu, Jun
